          "published": "Tue, 11 Aug 2026 09:29:52 +0800",
          "summary": "<p>财新网08月11日电: 沪指开盘报3950.71点，跌幅0.40%。</p><p>深成指报14266.44点，跌幅0.35%；创业板指报3533.89点，跌幅0.09%；中小板指报8806.60点，跌幅0.54%。</p><p>盘面上，机械设备领涨，石油石化、煤炭、钢铁、传媒、银行等板块涨幅居前，国防军工领跌，建筑材料、综合、社会服务、医药生物、基础化工等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，央行表示，强化金融市场制度建设，维护金融市场平稳运行；宇树科技10日开始申购，最终中签率0.0181%；台风“白海豚”深入内陆，多地大风暴雨来袭；商务部初步认定原产于墨西哥和美国的进口碧根果存在倾销；台积电7月收入环比增长5.6%，同比增长44.7%。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-08-11</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101022007\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101022007\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">宇树科技<p><span class=\"stock-no\">688836.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">12.35</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+10.71</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">险资曲线入股宇树科技不断扩大战新产业配置</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101002647\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101002647\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">建设机械<p><span class=\"stock-no\">600984.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">10.49</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+10.49</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">建设机械拟重大资产重组涉足煤化工领域</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101002324\"><div class=\"row-order\">3</div><